<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Theoretical Analysis of FAPO algorithm</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To better understand the effectiveness of FAPO and the whole learning process, we present a theoretical analysis.
We begin by comparing FAPO with baseline settings to illustrate how the optimization direction shifts during the RL process and how the corresponding advantage estimation evolves.
In this context, <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math> plays a crucial role in controlling the optimization dynamics. Building on this, we further introduce a parameter-free, majority-guided optimization strategy.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">In the context of LLM RL, we typically maximize the following clipped surrogate objective:</p>
<table id="A1.E9" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E9X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E9X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{J}_{\text{GRPO}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒥</mi><mtext>GRPO</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{J}_{\text{GRPO}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E9X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(\theta)=\mathbb{E}_{(q,a)\sim\mathcal{D},\{o_{i}\}_{i=1}^{G}\sim\pi_{\theta_{\text{old}}}(\cdot|q)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mo>,</mo><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>o</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>G</mi></msup><mo>∼</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(\theta)=\mathbb{E}_{(q,a)\sim\mathcal{D},\{o_{i}\}_{i=1}^{G}\sim\pi_{\theta_{\text{old}}}(\cdot|q)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(9)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E9Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E9Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{G}\sum_{i=1}^{G}\frac{1}{|o_{i}|}\sum_{t=1}^{|o_{i}|}\left\{\min\left[\frac{\pi_{\theta}(o_{t}|q,o_{&lt;t})}{\pi_{\theta_{\text{old}}}(o_{t}|q,o_{&lt;t})}\hat{A}_{i,t},\text{clip}(\frac{\pi_{\theta}(o_{t}|q,o_{&lt;t})}{\pi_{\theta_{\text{old}}}(o_{t}|q,o_{&lt;t})},1-\epsilon,1+\epsilon)\hat{A}_{i,t}\right]\right\}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>G</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mtext>clip</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{G}\sum_{i=1}^{G}\frac{1}{|o_{i}|}\sum_{t=1}^{|o_{i}|}\left\{\min\left[\frac{\pi_{\theta}(o_{t}|q,o_{&lt;t})}{\pi_{\theta_{\text{old}}}(o_{t}|q,o_{&lt;t})}\hat{A}_{i,t},\text{clip}(\frac{\pi_{\theta}(o_{t}|q,o_{&lt;t})}{\pi_{\theta_{\text{old}}}(o_{t}|q,o_{&lt;t})},1-\epsilon,1+\epsilon)\hat{A}_{i,t}\right]\right\},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p2.2" class="ltx_p">with advantage estimated in a group-relative manner:</p>
<table id="A1.E10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{i}=\begin{cases}1,&amp;\text{If}\;\;o_{i}\text{ is correct}\\
-1,&amp;\text{Otherwise}\end{cases},\quad\hat{A}_{i,t}=\frac{r_{i}-\text{mean}(\{R_{i}\}_{i=1}^{G})}{\text{std}(\{R_{i}\}_{i=1}^{G})}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mtext>If</mtext><mo lspace="0.560em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext> is correct</mtext></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mtext>Otherwise</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mtext>mean</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mtext>std</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{i}=\begin{cases}1,&amp;\text{If}\;\;o_{i}\text{ is correct}\\
-1,&amp;\text{Otherwise}\end{cases},\quad\hat{A}_{i,t}=\frac{r_{i}-\text{mean}(\{R_{i}\}_{i=1}^{G})}{\text{std}(\{R_{i}\}_{i=1}^{G})},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p2.3" class="ltx_p">In this context, <math id="A1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu_{\text{FAPO}}=\text{mean}(\{R_{i}\}_{i=1}^{G})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>mean</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu_{\text{FAPO}}=\text{mean}(\{R_{i}\}_{i=1}^{G})</annotation></semantics></math> determines the sign of the advantage <math id="A1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{A}_{i,t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{A}_{i,t}</annotation></semantics></math>, which in turn dictates the current optimization direction while <math id="A1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{std}(\{R_{i}\}_{i=1}^{G})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>std</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{std}(\{R_{i}\}_{i=1}^{G})</annotation></semantics></math> can be regarded as a scaling factor.
FAPO introduces the following modification to the reward function:</p>
<table id="A1.E11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{\text{GRPO}}=\begin{cases}1,&amp;\text{If}\;\;o\text{ is correct}\\
-1,&amp;\text{Otherwise}\end{cases}\;\;\xrightarrow{\text{penalty}}\;\;R_{\text{FAPO}}=\begin{cases}1,&amp;\text{If}\;\;o\text{ is fully correct}\\
1-\lambda&amp;\text{If}\;\;o\text{ is correct yet flawed}\\
-1,&amp;\text{Otherwise}\end{cases}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>GRPO</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mtext>If</mtext><mo lspace="0.560em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext> is correct</mtext></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mtext>Otherwise</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mover accent="true"><mo>→</mo><mtext mathsize="0.700em">penalty</mtext></mover><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mtext>If</mtext><mo lspace="0.560em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext> is fully correct</mtext></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mtext>If</mtext><mo lspace="0.560em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext> is correct yet flawed</mtext></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mtext>Otherwise</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{\text{GRPO}}=\begin{cases}1,&amp;\text{If}\;\;o\text{ is correct}\\
-1,&amp;\text{Otherwise}\end{cases}\;\;\xrightarrow{\text{penalty}}\;\;R_{\text{FAPO}}=\begin{cases}1,&amp;\text{If}\;\;o\text{ is fully correct}\\
1-\lambda&amp;\text{If}\;\;o\text{ is correct yet flawed}\\
-1,&amp;\text{Otherwise}\end{cases}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p2.4" class="ltx_p">We assume that the current sample contains <math id="A1.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math> rollouts, with a proportion of <math id="A1.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> fully correct positives and a proportion of <math id="A1.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math> negatives, leaving <math id="A1.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\alpha-\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\alpha-\beta</annotation></semantics></math> as flawed positives.
Since GRPO does not distinguish between fully correct and flawed positives, the resulting advantage estimation is:</p>
<table id="A1.E12" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E12X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E12X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mu_{\text{GRPO}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>GRPO</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mu_{\text{GRPO}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E12X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\text{mean}(\{R_{i}\}_{i=1}^{n})=\frac{1\times(1-\beta)n+(-1)\times\beta n}{n}=1-\beta-\beta=1-2\beta," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>mean</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\text{mean}(\{R_{i}\}_{i=1}^{n})=\frac{1\times(1-\beta)n+(-1)\times\beta n}{n}=1-\beta-\beta=1-2\beta,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="3" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E12Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E12Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sigma_{\text{GRPO}}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mtext>GRPO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sigma_{\text{GRPO}}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E12Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\text{std}(\{R_{i}\}_{i=1}^{n})^{2}=\tfrac{(1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}})^{2}\times(1-\beta)n+(-1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}})^{2}\times\beta n}{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>std</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>GRPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>GRPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\text{std}(\{R_{i}\}_{i=1}^{n})^{2}=\tfrac{(1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}})^{2}\times(1-\beta)n+(-1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}})^{2}\times\beta n}{n}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E12Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E12Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(1-\beta)(1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}})^{2}+\beta(1+\mu_{\text{GRPO}})^{2}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>GRPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>GRPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(1-\beta)(1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}})^{2}+\beta(1+\mu_{\text{GRPO}})^{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p2.5" class="ltx_p">while the advantage estimation of FAPO is</p>
<table id="A1.E13" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E13X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E13X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mu_{\text{FAPO}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mu_{\text{FAPO}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E13X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\text{mean}(\{R_{i}\}_{i=1}^{n})=\tfrac{1\times(\alpha n)+(1-\lambda)\times(n-\alpha n-\beta n)+(-1)\times\beta n}{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>mean</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\text{mean}(\{R_{i}\}_{i=1}^{n})=\tfrac{1\times(\alpha n)+(1-\lambda)\times(n-\alpha n-\beta n)+(-1)\times\beta n}{n}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="7" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E13Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E13Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\alpha+(1-\lambda)(1-\alpha-\beta)-\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\alpha+(1-\lambda)(1-\alpha-\beta)-\beta</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E13Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E13Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\alpha-\alpha(1-\lambda)-\beta-\beta(1-\lambda)+1-\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\alpha-\alpha(1-\lambda)-\beta-\beta(1-\lambda)+1-\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E13Xc" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E13Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=1-2\beta-(1-\alpha-\beta)\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=1-2\beta-(1-\alpha-\beta)\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E13Xd" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E13Xd.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mu_{\text{GRPO}}-(1-\alpha-\beta)\lambda," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>GRPO</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mu_{\text{GRPO}}-(1-\alpha-\beta)\lambda,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E13Xe" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E13Xe.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sigma_{\text{FAPO}}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sigma_{\text{FAPO}}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E13Xe.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\text{std}(\{R_{i}\}_{i=1}^{n})^{2}=\tfrac{(1-\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}\times\alpha n+(1-\lambda-\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}\times(n-\alpha n-\beta n)+(-1-\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}\times\beta n}{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>std</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\text{std}(\{R_{i}\}_{i=1}^{n})^{2}=\tfrac{(1-\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}\times\alpha n+(1-\lambda-\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}\times(n-\alpha n-\beta n)+(-1-\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}\times\beta n}{n}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E13Xf" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E13Xf.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\alpha(1-\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}+(1-\alpha-\beta)(1-\lambda-\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}+\beta(1+\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\alpha(1-\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}+(1-\alpha-\beta)(1-\lambda-\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}+\beta(1+\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p2.6" class="ltx_p">For <math id="A1.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{\text{FAPO}}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{\text{FAPO}}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, we let <math id="A1.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma=1-\alpha-\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma=1-\alpha-\beta</annotation></semantics></math>, so <math id="A1.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{\text{FAPO}}^{2}=\sigma_{\text{GRPO}}^{2}-\gamma\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mtext>GRPO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{\text{FAPO}}^{2}=\sigma_{\text{GRPO}}^{2}-\gamma\lambda</annotation></semantics></math>, then</p>
<table id="A1.E14" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E14X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sigma_{\text{FAPO}}^{2}=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sigma_{\text{FAPO}}^{2}=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\alpha(1-\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}+(1-\alpha-\beta)(1-\lambda-\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}+\beta(1+\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\alpha(1-\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}+(1-\alpha-\beta)(1-\lambda-\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}+\beta(1+\mu_{\text{FAPO}})^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="6" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E14Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\alpha(1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}}+\gamma\lambda)^{2}+\gamma(1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}}+\gamma\lambda-\lambda)^{2}+\beta(1+\mu_{\text{GRPO}}-\gamma\lambda)^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>GRPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>GRPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>GRPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\alpha(1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}}+\gamma\lambda)^{2}+\gamma(1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}}+\gamma\lambda-\lambda)^{2}+\beta(1+\mu_{\text{GRPO}}-\gamma\lambda)^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E14Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14Xb.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\color[rgb]{0,0.4,0}{\displaystyle[\alpha(1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}})^{2}+\gamma(1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}})^{2}+\beta(1+\mu_{\text{GRPO}})^{2}]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600" stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">−</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">μ</mi><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">GRPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">2</mn></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">+</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">−</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">μ</mi><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">GRPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">2</mn></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">+</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">+</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">μ</mi><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">GRPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;" mathcolor="#006600" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\color[rgb]{0,0.4,0}{\displaystyle[\alpha(1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}})^{2}+\gamma(1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}})^{2}+\beta(1+\mu_{\text{GRPO}})^{2}]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E14Xc" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+{\color[rgb]{0.75,0,0.25}[2\alpha\gamma\lambda(1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}})+2\gamma(1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}})(\gamma\lambda-\lambda)-2\beta(1+\mu_{\text{GRPO}})\gamma\lambda]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040" stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">−</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">μ</mi><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">GRPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">+</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">−</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">μ</mi><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">GRPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">λ</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">λ</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">−</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">+</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">μ</mi><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">GRPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040">λ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;" mathcolor="#BF0040" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+{\color[rgb]{0.75,0,0.25}[2\alpha\gamma\lambda(1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}})+2\gamma(1-\mu_{\text{GRPO}})(\gamma\lambda-\lambda)-2\beta(1+\mu_{\text{GRPO}})\gamma\lambda]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E14Xd" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14Xd.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+{\color[rgb]{0,0,1}[\alpha\gamma^{2}\lambda^{2}+\gamma(\gamma-1)^{2}\lambda^{2}+\beta\gamma^{2}\lambda^{2}]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF" stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">γ</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">λ</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">2</mn></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">+</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">γ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">λ</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">2</mn></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">+</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">γ</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">λ</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+{\color[rgb]{0,0,1}[\alpha\gamma^{2}\lambda^{2}+\gamma(\gamma-1)^{2}\lambda^{2}+\beta\gamma^{2}\lambda^{2}]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
