</table>
<p id="A1.p2.7" class="ltx_p">We break <math id="A1.p2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{\text{FAPO}}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mtext>FAPO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{\text{FAPO}}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> down into three sub-expressions (<span id="A1.p2.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#006600;">A</span>, <span id="A1.p2.7.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;">B</span>, <span id="A1.p2.7.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">C</span>) and simplify them separately.</p>
