<br class="ltx_break">{<span id="A6.p2.pic1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">problem statement</span>} 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{}. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A6.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p2.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Prompt for GPQA-Diamond:<span id="A6.p2.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">{<span id="A6.p2.pic1.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">problem statement</span>} 
