<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Flawed Positive Samples with Human Analysis</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A7.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="1518.7" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 1518.7" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,1518.7) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4D4D4D;" fill="#4D4D4D" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.04 L 0 1513.66 C 0 1516.44 2.26 1518.7 5.04 1518.7 L 544.96 1518.7 C 547.74 1518.7 550 1516.44 550 1513.66 L 550 5.04 C 550 2.26 547.74 0 544.96 0 L 5.04 0 C 2.26 0 0 2.26 0 5.04 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 5.04 L 1.11 1497.08 L 548.89 1497.08 L 548.89 5.04 C 548.89 2.87 547.13 1.11 544.96 1.11 L 5.04 1.11 C 2.87 1.11 1.11 2.87 1.11 5.04 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000080;" fill="#000080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 1498.19 L 1.11 1513.66 C 1.11 1515.83 2.87 1517.59 5.04 1517.59 L 544.96 1517.59 C 547.13 1517.59 548.89 1515.83 548.89 1513.66 L 548.89 1498.19 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.79 1505.2)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.99em;--ltx-fo-height:0.61em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.22em;font-size:10pt;" height="11.53" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.46)" width="484.16"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.99em;">
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Flawed Positive Example 1</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.79 186.69)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.99em;--ltx-fo-height:93.85em;--ltx-fo-depth:12.56em;font-size:10pt;" height="1472.37" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 1298.6)" width="484.16"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.99em;">
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question Source: AIME24<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Question:<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">Alice chooses a set <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math> of positive integers. Then Bob lists all finite nonempty sets <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> of positive integers with the property that the maximum element of <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> belongs to <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math>. Bob’s list has 2024 sets. Find the sum of the elements of A. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Generation Model: Qwen2.5-Math-7B (Pre-Trained Base Model)<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Response:<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">We are given that Bob lists all finite nonempty sets <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> of positive integers where the maximum element of <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> belongs to <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math>. Bob’s list contains 2024 such sets. We need to find the sum of the elements of <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math>.
</span></span></span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step-by-Step Reasoning:
</span></span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1. <span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Understanding the Problem:</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Let <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A=\{a_{1},a_{2},\ldots,a_{n}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">A</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></msub></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A=\{a_{1},a_{2},\ldots,a_{n}\}</annotation></semantics></math> where <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{1}&lt;a_{2}&lt;\ldots&lt;a_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{1}&lt;a_{2}&lt;\ldots&lt;a_{n}</annotation></semantics></math>.
</span></span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- For each <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}\in A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}\in A</annotation></semantics></math>, Bob lists all finite nonempty sets <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> such that the maximum element of <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>.
</span></span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. <span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Counting the Sets for Each <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>:</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- For a given <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, the sets <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> can include any subset of the integers less than <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, plus <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> itself.
</span></span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- The number of subsets of the integers less than <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2^{a_{i}-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2^{a_{i}-1}</annotation></semantics></math> (since there are <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}-1</annotation></semantics></math> integers less than <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>).
</span></span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- However, since <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> must be nonempty, we subtract 1 from this count (the empty set).
</span></span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#800000;">Therefore, the number of sets <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#800000;" mathcolor="#800000">B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> for a given <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#800000;" mathcolor="#800000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#800000;" mathcolor="#800000">i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is:
</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex1" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2^{a_{i}-1}-1" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#800000;" mathcolor="#800000">2</mn><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#800000;" mathcolor="#800000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#800000;" mathcolor="#800000">i</mi></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#800000;" mathcolor="#800000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#800000;" mathcolor="#800000">1</mn></mrow></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#800000;" mathcolor="#800000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#800000;" mathcolor="#800000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2^{a_{i}-1}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">3. <span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.12.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Total Number of Sets:</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- The total number of sets listed by Bob is the sum of the number of sets for each <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>:
</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{i=1}^{n}(2^{a_{i}-1}-1)=2024" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></munderover><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2024</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{i=1}^{n}(2^{a_{i}-1}-1)=2024</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Simplifying, we get:
</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{i=1}^{n}2^{a_{i}-1}-n=2024" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></munderover><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2024</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{i=1}^{n}2^{a_{i}-1}-n=2024</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{i=1}^{n}2^{a_{i}-1}=2024+n" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></munderover><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2024</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{i=1}^{n}2^{a_{i}-1}=2024+n</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">4. <span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.15.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Finding <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>:</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.16" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- We need to find <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math> such that the sum <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{i=1}^{n}2^{a_{i}-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∑</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></msubsup><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{i=1}^{n}2^{a_{i}-1}</annotation></semantics></math> is minimized.
</span></span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.17" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- The smallest possible values for <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">a</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> are <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1,2,3,\ldots,n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1,2,3,\ldots,n</annotation></semantics></math>.
</span></span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.18" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.18.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Let’s test with small values of <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m33" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>:
</span></span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.19" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- For <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m34" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=1</annotation></semantics></math>:
</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2^{1-1}=1\quad\text{(too small)}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#000000">(too small)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2^{1-1}=1\quad\text{(too small)}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.20" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- For <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m35" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=2</annotation></semantics></math>:
</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex6" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2^{1-1}+2^{2-1}=1+2=3\quad\text{(too small)}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#000000">(too small)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2^{1-1}+2^{2-1}=1+2=3\quad\text{(too small)}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.21" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.pic1.2.21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- For <math id="A7.p1.pic1.m36" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=3</annotation></semantics></math>:
</span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A7.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2^{1-1}+2^{2-1}+2^{3-1}=1+2+4=7\quad\text{(too small)}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><msup><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#000000">(too small)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2^{1-1}+2^{2-1}+2^{3-1}=1+2+4=7\quad\text{(too small)}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
